OL,3,AFamily of girl murdered by ex given law
OL,4,Achange hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaur said: "Stories like Holly's are
OL,7,Fwhy we are deploying the full power of
OL,8,Fthe state to halve violence against
OL,9,Fwomen and girls in a decade."
